### 1. GET Semua Data Destinasi Wisata (View Data)
GET http://localhost:3001/destinations
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET Satu Data Destinasi Wisata Berdasarkan ID
GET http://localhost:3001/destinations/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. POST Tambah Destinasi Wisata Baru ke Database Supabase
POST http://localhost:3001/destinations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Labuan Bajo",
  "location": "Nusa Tenggara Timur",
  "tag": "Laut",
  "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555400038-63f5ba517a47?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80",
  "description": "Gerbang menuju Taman Nasional Komodo dengan gugusan pulau eksotis dan kapal phinisi."
}

### 4. PATCH Update Data Destinasi Wisata
PATCH http://localhost:3001/destinations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Raja Ampat, Papua Barat Daya"
}

### 5. DELETE Hapus Data Destinasi Wisata
DELETE http://localhost:3001/destinations/4
